{"parse": {"title": "NWE-08", "pageid": 69811, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/NWE-07\" title=\"NWE-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">NWE-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">NWE</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B2.B3\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"河\">河</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 河</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">River</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>静<span class=\"color-value\"></span>静<span class=\"color-value\"></span>流<span class=\"color-value\"></span>淌<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>始<span class=\"color-value\"></span>终<span class=\"color-value\"></span>如<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191808</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奔跑、奔跑……穿过草丛，翻过高墙，再穿过这通隧道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>圣洛夫基金会之外的自由世界就在那里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>哈、哈、哈……你们拦不住我，这下你们谁也拦不住我了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>基金会的猎犬们，也会有鼻子失灵的一天！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他力竭的身体，仍在黑暗中不停迈步，宛如一具行尸走肉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那颗太妃糖，在奔跑中，从他的兜里抖落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>呵……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他抬起脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>糖块儿变成了碎渣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>你们偏袒人类，让我的母亲白白死在报复我的人类手里，没有做任何公正的审判——却还指望我能继续帮你们？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脚步再次轴动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>擦掉脸上因跌落而流出的鲜血，他的眼神里已满是癫狂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>哈、哈……加入你们，背叛重塑之手是我做过最愚蠢的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>但这次……这次我已经获取了你们内部的情报！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>勿忘我先生……会对我网开一面，而那个人类凶手——重塑之手的同僚们一定会让他付出代价！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他已经听见了风声，隧道出口的光正扑面而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在那尽头，接应自己的人已经抵达……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰瑞·威尔逊：</div><div>我……自由了！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仪器屏幕上，渺小的光标正缓缓移动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>如你所愿，佩德拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>捕鼠器起作用了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一个未曾透露的机密。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-508101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-508101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-508101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">佩德拉：</div><div>接下来，就让我们瞧瞧这只小老鼠会钻进哪个窝吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxin\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-564501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-564501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-564501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">实习职员亚当：</div><div>好了，柯布先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-564501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-564501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-564501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">实习职员亚当：</div><div>夜晚的散步时间结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-564501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-564501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-564501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">实习职员亚当：</div><div>让我带您回房间好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他搀扶着佝偻着腰的老人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜晚的走廊只有他们的足音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>我有没有跟你说过，我曾经三次踏入过同一条河流？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-564501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-564501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-564501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">实习职员亚当：</div><div>柯布先生……您已经说过很多回了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他望向职员，就像第一次见到他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>抱歉，你叫什么名字？我想这还是咱们第一次见面……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-564501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-564501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ad/HeadIconSmall-564501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">实习职员亚当：</div><div>亚当，先生……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>柯布揉了揉已皱巴巴的鼻子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那佝偻的背，已令他感到累赘无比。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>总之，孩子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>那是我第三次踏入那条河流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>我衰老得要命，忘记了自己身处何处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>他们说，我的脑子正在往回走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的脑海头一次如此澄澈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>我的家室庞大，孩子们把我囚禁在屋子里，锁死了门窗，可我总是记不清他们谁是谁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>那一天，我偷偷跑了出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>我又回到了那儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>有些人说，我们永不能踏入同一条河流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>孩子们说，那条河流早就干涸，什么也不剩下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>可我知道那都是谎话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他闭上了眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>因为……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>呀，你看见了吗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"564401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"564401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-564401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-564401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">病人柯布：</div><div>我走失的小狗，一直躲在河边的那岸啊。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "NWE-08"}}